1
00:00:04,260 --> 00:00:06,577
I felt your conquerors, Haki.

2
00:00:06,660 --> 00:00:09,300
It resonated through your every punch.

3
00:00:22,440 --> 00:00:23,680
A shame.

4
00:00:24,060 --> 00:00:25,357
The technique was right.

5
00:00:25,440 --> 00:00:28,300
But the execution was sorely lacking.

6
00:00:32,840 --> 00:00:34,560
What did you call it?

7
00:00:41,200 --> 00:00:44,020
Go ahead, keep coming at me.

8
00:00:44,420 --> 00:00:46,540
I'm enjoying this.

9
00:00:50,160 --> 00:00:52,040
Come, come, what?

10
00:00:55,640 --> 00:00:58,000
Ro-ro-ro-ro-ro!

11
00:01:10,740 --> 00:01:16,420
Another pirate who couldn't be
Joy Boy, just like the rest of us.

12
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:33,620
Within brings out a map of your own

13
00:01:38,440 --> 00:01:41,180
To the left and the right All we saw,

14
00:01:41,380 --> 00:01:44,437
stormy nights All the rough
winds and waves Coming day

15
00:01:44,520 --> 00:01:48,897
after day And the values we
had Were about to collapse Oh,

16
00:01:48,980 --> 00:01:51,240
just where do we go next?

17
00:01:51,620 --> 00:01:57,800
And as we look down To the compass in
hand Is it showing us the right direction?

18
00:01:58,120 --> 00:02:03,417
All we know is nobody here knows it for
certain so close your eyes and breathe

19
00:02:03,500 --> 00:02:08,437
in deeply and listen to your soul you'll

20
00:02:08,520 --> 00:02:11,937
see a path in front of you and you'll

21
00:02:12,020 --> 00:02:15,797
know just where you need to go so stand

22
00:02:15,880 --> 00:02:18,957
up tall reach out your hand cut through

23
00:02:19,040 --> 00:02:25,240
the wind and make a stand Don't let the
darkness sway and just break through

24
00:02:26,980 --> 00:02:32,080
I'll do it my own way, that's what's
best for me And you do it your way,

25
00:02:32,180 --> 00:02:36,200
that's how it's got to
be We're moving forward,

26
00:02:36,580 --> 00:02:37,840
now I'm ready

27
00:02:38,460 --> 00:02:42,057
But at times it's okay to
get help on the way For the

28
00:02:42,140 --> 00:02:46,720
future ahead burning bright
For what's ahead you see

29
00:02:47,460 --> 00:02:52,517
Is beyond your wildest
dreams So stand up tall,

30
00:02:52,600 --> 00:02:55,957
reach out your hand Cut through the wind

31
00:02:56,040 --> 00:02:59,497
and make a stand Don't
let the darkness win,

32
00:02:59,580 --> 00:03:01,220
just break through

33
00:03:02,840 --> 00:03:04,780
We'll do it our way,

34
00:03:04,920 --> 00:03:08,517
the best that we know With tears
and doubts and toll We'll go

35
00:03:08,600 --> 00:03:15,080
where we all wanna go The pain
within brings colors of our own

36
00:03:32,480 --> 00:03:37,580
Hey, raccoon, get wrecked!

37
00:03:47,360 --> 00:03:49,160
He grabbed him!

38
00:03:58,100 --> 00:03:59,420
He's strong!

39
00:04:25,320 --> 00:04:27,280
He's overpowering Twain!

40
00:04:27,420 --> 00:04:28,260
That's insane!

41
00:04:29,040 --> 00:04:31,240
Indeed, quite so.

42
00:04:39,020 --> 00:04:42,200
You're breathing awfully hard, Raccoon.

43
00:04:42,300 --> 00:04:44,077
Are you sure you're winning this?

44
00:04:44,160 --> 00:04:45,760
Or was that all for show?

45
00:04:46,320 --> 00:04:47,300
Come on!

46
00:04:47,520 --> 00:04:48,420
Pick it up!

47
00:04:53,960 --> 00:04:56,220
Your power is lickety-spent.

48
00:04:57,700 --> 00:04:59,000
Time to die.

49
00:04:59,400 --> 00:05:00,500
No hiding.

50
00:05:00,880 --> 00:05:02,060
Not for me.

51
00:05:02,480 --> 00:05:03,560
Hard for you!

52
00:05:05,180 --> 00:05:07,897
You've sure been hard to
track down, young master.

53
00:05:07,980 --> 00:05:08,810
Come quietly.

54
00:05:08,893 --> 00:05:10,073
We don't want to fight.

55
00:05:10,860 --> 00:05:11,690
Huh?

56
00:05:11,773 --> 00:05:12,603
Wait a sec.

57
00:05:13,380 --> 00:05:15,980
Is that Momonosuke? Yeah!

58
00:05:16,200 --> 00:05:18,480
He's got that smug look in his eyes!

59
00:05:19,080 --> 00:05:20,120
Hold on!

60
00:05:20,440 --> 00:05:22,675
The young master's handcuffs are gone!

61
00:05:22,960 --> 00:05:23,940
That's right!

62
00:05:24,240 --> 00:05:26,180
I'm Kozuki Udon after all!

63
00:05:27,820 --> 00:05:31,160
And that means that I'm free!

64
00:05:37,640 --> 00:05:38,470
Shinobu...

65
00:05:38,880 --> 00:05:39,710
Yes?

66
00:05:39,793 --> 00:05:40,660
This settles it.

67
00:05:41,520 --> 00:05:44,437
I cannot meet my end yet. Meet your end?

68
00:05:44,520 --> 00:05:45,737
Why would you say that?

69
00:05:45,820 --> 00:05:47,349
We're here to protect you.

70
00:05:49,540 --> 00:05:50,940
I said someone!

71
00:05:51,240 --> 00:05:52,260
But who is it?

72
00:05:56,200 --> 00:05:57,788
What's the matter, my lord?

73
00:06:02,540 --> 00:06:04,660
Guess who we found, Commander?

74
00:06:05,040 --> 00:06:06,580
It's Mama Nosuke!

75
00:06:06,960 --> 00:06:08,280
I'll be there soon.

76
00:06:08,700 --> 00:06:09,597
Okie dokie!

77
00:06:09,680 --> 00:06:12,880
Relay a message to all
of Onigashima, Baohuang.

78
00:06:13,780 --> 00:06:16,560
Tell them my battle
against Straw Hat is over.

79
00:06:17,480 --> 00:06:19,960
There's no point in struggling any longer.

80
00:06:20,600 --> 00:06:21,680
They've lost.

81
00:06:30,000 --> 00:06:31,620
He's firing again!

82
00:06:31,940 --> 00:06:33,469
Take cover or you're dead!

83
00:06:33,860 --> 00:06:35,337
There's no one left to go!

84
00:06:35,420 --> 00:06:36,479
We're all screwed!

85
00:06:41,880 --> 00:06:42,710
Oh!

86
00:06:42,793 --> 00:06:43,780
Chopper Emon, stop!

87
00:06:44,800 --> 00:06:46,660
I've got less than ten minutes.

88
00:06:46,860 --> 00:06:49,331
Then my Rumble Ball's power will wear off.

89
00:06:50,200 --> 00:06:53,620
It's longer than before,
but it's still not enough.

90
00:07:01,800 --> 00:07:05,020
Is that really the best you can do? Huh?

91
00:07:05,640 --> 00:07:07,697
Three minutes is no time at all.

92
00:07:07,780 --> 00:07:10,560
Seems a little half-assed, in my opinion.

93
00:07:11,860 --> 00:07:16,417
But if I'm a monster for more than ten
minutes, there might be some side effects.

94
00:07:16,500 --> 00:07:17,940
But who gives a damn?

95
00:07:18,260 --> 00:07:20,495
What, do you only care about yourself?

96
00:07:21,540 --> 00:07:23,660
Some pirate you are.

97
00:07:23,800 --> 00:07:24,700
What'd you say?

98
00:07:28,520 --> 00:07:30,720
Fetch me the chemicals I ask for.

99
00:07:31,140 --> 00:07:35,380
The gigantification will be
extended to thirty minutes.

100
00:07:35,640 --> 00:07:37,280
That's ten times longer.

101
00:07:37,780 --> 00:07:39,880
It's risky, of course.

102
00:07:40,240 --> 00:07:42,820
But you're not scared, are you?

103
00:07:43,920 --> 00:07:45,580
Of course I'm not.

104
00:07:45,820 --> 00:07:47,880
I am a pirate, after all.

105
00:07:58,280 --> 00:08:00,740
Black coffee beam!

106
00:08:08,620 --> 00:08:10,700
Trying to sneak away?

107
00:08:16,080 --> 00:08:18,060
You've got nothing!

108
00:08:18,840 --> 00:08:21,240
Now time to die!

109
00:08:28,020 --> 00:08:30,000
Hey, Mary's!

110
00:08:30,500 --> 00:08:33,080
Go, go, to Fusion Mode!

111
00:08:39,820 --> 00:08:40,650
Onigashima!

112
00:08:40,733 --> 00:08:42,940
May I have your attention, please?

113
00:08:43,640 --> 00:08:46,680
The duel is over, everybody!

114
00:08:47,100 --> 00:08:49,920
The enemy with the highest bounty, Mr.

115
00:08:50,160 --> 00:08:52,777
Straw Hat Luffy himself...

116
00:08:52,860 --> 00:08:55,020
has been defeated!

117
00:08:58,020 --> 00:08:59,380
Shaprima, no!

118
00:09:05,020 --> 00:09:06,520
That's not good.

119
00:09:07,860 --> 00:09:09,080
Seems it's settled.

120
00:09:09,240 --> 00:09:10,580
That's right, folks!

121
00:09:10,820 --> 00:09:13,400
Commander Kyno chased the life out of him!

122
00:09:13,620 --> 00:09:15,260
Isn't that great? Ha!

123
00:09:15,680 --> 00:09:16,560
You hear that?

124
00:09:16,880 --> 00:09:18,920
One, two, three, sir!

125
00:09:24,940 --> 00:09:31,420
Then, Straw Hat Luffy sank like a rock
deeper and deeper into the dark, dark sea.

126
00:09:32,040 --> 00:09:33,120
Ha ha! Good news!

127
00:09:42,020 --> 00:09:43,297
What, are you kidding me?

128
00:09:43,380 --> 00:09:45,439
Let the idiot drown for all I care.

129
00:09:45,920 --> 00:09:48,100
The Kozuki Samurai are down.

130
00:09:48,620 --> 00:09:50,480
Straw Hat is down.

131
00:09:50,800 --> 00:09:52,000
Who's left?

132
00:09:52,260 --> 00:09:54,240
Can anyone else step up?

133
00:09:54,380 --> 00:09:56,020
Is anyone strong enough?

134
00:09:57,260 --> 00:09:59,440
He stopped the Samurai too?

135
00:10:00,900 --> 00:10:02,800
Take that with me!

136
00:10:03,980 --> 00:10:07,980
Commander Kaido is coming
downstairs to clean out his castle!

137
00:10:09,080 --> 00:10:10,597
Look at that giant hole.

138
00:10:10,680 --> 00:10:12,360
Thanks for nothing but that.

139
00:10:13,380 --> 00:10:18,120
But the good news is, our final
leader will accept your surrender!

140
00:10:18,980 --> 00:10:21,600
All you have to do is
be nice and obedient,

141
00:10:21,860 --> 00:10:24,497
put your hands in the air,
and promise not to fight!

142
00:10:24,580 --> 00:10:31,080
Then, you'll be welcomed as a member of
our crew, and we won't have to kill you!

143
00:10:31,340 --> 00:10:32,170
Huh?

144
00:10:32,253 --> 00:10:33,120
Not a chance!

145
00:10:35,880 --> 00:10:38,500
Lord Mobinosuke! What is it? What's wrong?

146
00:11:04,680 --> 00:11:06,140
Get him on!

147
00:11:06,660 --> 00:11:07,520
I am here!

148
00:11:08,180 --> 00:11:09,717
I have to...

149
00:11:09,800 --> 00:11:11,920
I have to tell everyone!

150
00:11:13,620 --> 00:11:15,420
Surrender, Land of Wano!

151
00:11:15,880 --> 00:11:18,260
This is a losing battle!

152
00:11:18,520 --> 00:11:21,220
In fact, it's already lost.

153
00:11:22,180 --> 00:11:24,280
Let me say it again for you.

154
00:11:24,500 --> 00:11:29,640
Straw Hat Luffy was defeated and sank
to the bottom of the dark, dark sea.

155
00:11:30,020 --> 00:11:32,000
This frog is a Mary, isn't it?

156
00:11:32,240 --> 00:11:35,717
If there's one in the room with
us, then it's already too late.

157
00:11:35,800 --> 00:11:37,160
They know where we are.

158
00:11:39,760 --> 00:11:40,590
Listen.

159
00:11:47,360 --> 00:11:48,190
Disgusting.

160
00:11:49,240 --> 00:11:51,060
Hello, anyone in there?

161
00:11:52,540 --> 00:11:54,220
I know that voice.

162
00:11:54,580 --> 00:11:56,180
Hello, Momonosuke.

163
00:11:56,980 --> 00:11:58,960
It's been quite a while.

164
00:11:59,440 --> 00:12:01,020
It can't be, my lord.

165
00:12:01,200 --> 00:12:02,800
And Shinobu, too.

166
00:12:03,120 --> 00:12:04,880
What a fine reunion this is.

167
00:12:06,580 --> 00:12:08,260
Father, you're alive.

168
00:12:10,660 --> 00:12:14,340
Shinobu, he's not real.
You're here. You've returned.

169
00:12:14,980 --> 00:12:17,200
Do not look at him. Why?

170
00:12:18,780 --> 00:12:20,120
Don't be cool.

171
00:12:20,320 --> 00:12:21,620
Let the poor boy go.

172
00:12:22,000 --> 00:12:24,760
It's a heartwarming
reunion for our family.

173
00:12:25,100 --> 00:12:26,180
How dare you?

174
00:12:27,060 --> 00:12:28,480
Get back, Shinobu!

175
00:12:30,640 --> 00:12:33,660
You don't like poor old Odin anymore?

176
00:12:35,300 --> 00:12:36,557
Cease your lies!

177
00:12:36,640 --> 00:12:38,220
You've mocked us enough!

178
00:12:38,460 --> 00:12:39,380
It's over!

179
00:12:40,240 --> 00:12:41,940
Kiku, that's rude.

180
00:12:42,100 --> 00:12:44,277
Why don't you put that nasty sword away?

181
00:12:44,360 --> 00:12:45,948
I'm still your lord, right?

182
00:12:51,100 --> 00:12:53,340
Monster, you killed Arshina!

183
00:13:03,660 --> 00:13:05,100
You're making a mistake!

184
00:13:05,440 --> 00:13:06,675
It's really me, Kiku!

185
00:13:06,800 --> 00:13:08,060
Don't speak my name!

186
00:13:08,240 --> 00:13:10,700
Not with his face! Kanjuro!

187
00:13:15,940 --> 00:13:17,740
This is the thanks I get.

188
00:13:17,880 --> 00:13:19,300
After all I did for you!

189
00:13:19,640 --> 00:13:22,660
Remember the first meal I
shared with you and Izo?

190
00:13:29,300 --> 00:13:30,920
So, let's hear it.

191
00:13:31,440 --> 00:13:32,793
Where are your parents?

192
00:13:38,040 --> 00:13:40,440
Can't bring yourself to do it, can you?

193
00:14:02,780 --> 00:14:04,680
I'm sorry, Master Keen.

194
00:14:04,840 --> 00:14:07,277
Just as he said, they couldn't do it.

195
00:14:07,360 --> 00:14:08,640
God, you know

196
00:14:33,720 --> 00:14:37,073
You didn't have any trouble
cutting me down the last time

197
00:14:39,900 --> 00:14:43,400
Thanks to you, we're both
critically injured, Kiku!

198
00:14:46,640 --> 00:14:47,470
No!

199
00:14:49,160 --> 00:14:53,040
Master Keen, I have failed
you for the last time.

200
00:14:54,220 --> 00:14:59,020
Kiku Nojo of the Fallen Snow
shall meet her end this day.

201
00:15:00,860 --> 00:15:03,800
However, if the Fallen Snow is melting,

202
00:15:05,620 --> 00:15:07,920
that means dawn is coming.

203
00:15:08,640 --> 00:15:11,200
To shine on the land of Wano.

204
00:15:13,080 --> 00:15:14,800
Well spoken, Kiku.

205
00:15:16,800 --> 00:15:20,537
And that dawn will be
so bright that it will

206
00:15:20,620 --> 00:15:23,080
shine upon our friends in the afterworld.

207
00:15:28,840 --> 00:15:29,670
Kiku!

208
00:15:29,900 --> 00:15:30,880
Kiku Nojo!

209
00:15:34,680 --> 00:15:36,520
If only we had an audience.

210
00:15:37,260 --> 00:15:40,257
Surely your performance
would get a standing ovation.

211
00:15:40,340 --> 00:15:41,740
Ka-ka-ka!

212
00:15:42,440 --> 00:15:45,700
And now it's time for
your final scene, Keen.

213
00:15:49,100 --> 00:15:51,360
Ka-ka! Worry not.

214
00:15:51,560 --> 00:15:54,266
I'll set the stage so
that you die gloriously.

215
00:16:00,960 --> 00:16:04,840
His lord was killed, and he was
betrayed by his dear friend.

216
00:16:05,240 --> 00:16:06,358
Long has he fought.

217
00:16:06,520 --> 00:16:09,900
And now his comrades fall
before him one by one.

218
00:16:10,100 --> 00:16:11,140
What a tragedy

219
00:16:13,780 --> 00:16:17,120
Or perhaps it's a comedy

220
00:16:20,500 --> 00:16:23,417
The entire audience is waiting in suspense

221
00:16:23,500 --> 00:16:26,840
decorate the stage with
your dazzling death

222
00:16:59,780 --> 00:17:00,920
Splendid work

223
00:17:02,440 --> 00:17:03,780
Hold on a sec

224
00:17:04,860 --> 00:17:07,960
We are not taking this
freak in! Just look at him!

225
00:17:08,120 --> 00:17:09,708
Why are you being so cruel?

226
00:17:09,880 --> 00:17:11,940
I said I was sorry over and over!

227
00:17:12,160 --> 00:17:14,117
What more do you want from me, huh?

228
00:17:14,200 --> 00:17:15,030
Kanjino!

229
00:17:15,800 --> 00:17:17,460
Hell, I've missed you!

230
00:17:18,940 --> 00:17:19,770
Correct.

231
00:17:19,853 --> 00:17:22,137
That's the sound that
Raizo makes when he runs.

232
00:17:22,220 --> 00:17:24,338
Just another one of his many skills.

233
00:17:25,420 --> 00:17:27,657
It's Ningpo. Blindfolding technique.

234
00:17:27,740 --> 00:17:28,720
Now, guess who?

235
00:17:28,880 --> 00:17:30,292
It's Kanjino, of course.

236
00:17:30,540 --> 00:17:32,305
There's no one else behind me.

237
00:17:33,820 --> 00:17:35,200
Hit the truck!

238
00:17:39,840 --> 00:17:41,500
Oh, you trickster, you!

239
00:17:51,860 --> 00:17:55,540
There is no one more suited to
lower the curtain on my play.

240
00:17:55,880 --> 00:17:57,520
I give you my thanks!

241
00:18:04,580 --> 00:18:09,920
We shared this stage as
best friends, didn't we?

242
00:18:10,640 --> 00:18:12,580
What a tale it's been.

243
00:18:38,080 --> 00:18:39,440
Kiku?

244
00:18:40,120 --> 00:18:41,200
Master King.

245
00:19:07,000 --> 00:19:12,600
Well, well, so this is where
you scurried off to, little rat.

246
00:19:14,060 --> 00:19:17,360
Shinobu, take Lord Momonosuke
and run away! Hurry!

247
00:19:18,320 --> 00:19:19,160
All right.

248
00:19:24,460 --> 00:19:26,097
Out of my way, samurai.

249
00:19:26,180 --> 00:19:27,940
This is your last chance.

250
00:19:29,960 --> 00:19:31,180
I refuse!

251
00:19:31,660 --> 00:19:35,080
No matter the odds I face,
I cannot let you pass!

252
00:19:37,040 --> 00:19:38,740
I'll crush you!

253
00:20:00,220 --> 00:20:03,600
Oh, oh, oh, oh!

254
00:20:05,840 --> 00:20:07,840
Give me more!

255
00:20:28,680 --> 00:20:29,510
Luffy!

256
00:20:36,000 --> 00:20:36,830
Luffy!

257
00:20:41,000 --> 00:20:42,080
No way.

258
00:20:42,660 --> 00:20:44,860
It's gotta be a lie, right?

259
00:20:49,920 --> 00:20:52,440
What are we supposed to do now?

260
00:20:52,900 --> 00:20:56,100
If you're not here,
then it's all pointless.

261
00:20:57,360 --> 00:20:58,190
Loopy!

262
00:21:07,040 --> 00:21:09,220
Straw Hat's been defeated, they said.

263
00:21:09,380 --> 00:21:11,968
Is there anyone left
who can take out Kaido?

264
00:21:12,160 --> 00:21:15,577
Bao Huang's announcement filled
the samurai with uncertainty.

265
00:21:15,660 --> 00:21:20,072
And in an instant, their conviction
began to waver and give way to despair.

266
00:21:21,660 --> 00:21:22,490
Mr.

267
00:21:22,573 --> 00:21:23,853
Straw Hat was defeated?

268
00:21:23,980 --> 00:21:25,097
It can't be!

269
00:21:25,180 --> 00:21:27,580
